<!--
    Kannada (kn) — NEEDS NATIVE REVIEW BEFORE RELEASE.

    Translated without a native speaker. The terminology choices worth checking
    first, because they repeat everywhere:
      · "request"      → "ಬೇಡಿಕೆ"
      · "delivered"    → "ಕೊಟ್ಟಾಗಿದೆ"
      · "pending"      → "ಬಾಕಿ"
      · "prescription" → "ಚೀಟಿ"

    Brand and protocol names (MedQueue, WhatsApp, SMS, +91) are deliberately
    absent so they fall back to values/strings.xml untranslated.

    Manrope carries no Kannada glyphs; the platform falls back to Noto Sans
    Kannada per-glyph, so metrics will differ slightly from the Latin UI.
-->
